### Submission deliverables ###
# The report, the slides and the workbook are submission artefacts, not source.
# They live on disk and are handed in separately; keeping 6 MB of binaries in
# version control means every edit to a paragraph pushes a new copy.
PFE_Report.docx
PFE_Report.pdf
PFE_Defence.pptx
PFE_Defence.pdf
PFE_Cover_Page.docx
PFE_Cover_Page.pdf
PFE_Evaluation_Results.xlsx

